Z||000000||firstfiero||08-17-2001||10:22 AM||||     Well it's that time of year that my wifes parents want to trade our car in and get us a new one. God forbid you should need wind shield wipers or something...better trade her in befor you have it a year and the problems start. Anyway last night he calls and asks me what we want...and as always I say a bmw expecting to get the same reply as always...Noooooo has to be American. Instead to my astonishment he says..Alright,whatever you want captain take the blazer into the dealer tomorrow and have them call me.  HOLY S***!!! I'M GETTING A BIMMER! I don't want to sound like I'm bragging...I'm just stoked and wanted to vent somewhere. <BR>      I'm getting a 3 series...can any of you guys help me with what to get. probobly be a 325i...the 330's are little pricey. I thought they had a 328 but I can't find it on their site anymore. <P>------------------<BR><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/firstfiero.gif"> ||||reg||14
